Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:02:13.70,0:02:15.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BAND coughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:02:15.94,0:02:17.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the...? Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:17.70,0:02:20.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROOK laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:02:22.68,0:02:24.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh! Buncha fools!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:24.86,0:02:27.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why did you have to get\Nall sentimental like that?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:27.30,0:02:29.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now we can't cash in on his bounty!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:32.00,0:02:35.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}If you don't get out of our way,\Nwe'll arrest every last one of you!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:35.30,0:02:36.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'd like to see you try!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:36.57,0:02:39.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Just let the man play his\Nrock n' roll damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.68,0:02:41.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[EDITOR A]\NHey, what's going on over there?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:41.11,0:02:42.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's outta control,\NI'll tell you that much!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.17,0:02:47.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Navy came to arrest Soul King during\Nhis show and now his fans are rioting!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:47.28,0:02:50.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like he made his escape, though.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:50.39,0:02:53.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You skinless traitor!\NI'm gonna make you pay!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.89,0:02:54.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:02:54.93,0:02:56.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[REPORTER A]\NAnyway, that's not the big story here.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:56.53,0:02:59.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Soul King is actually a pirate\Nknown as the Humming Swordsman.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.50,0:03:01.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's one of the Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:03.76,0:03:07.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROOK laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.46,0:03:09.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the ride, my friend.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:09.73,0:03:11.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And that was impeccable\Ntiming, I must say!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:11.94,0:03:14.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can thank Shakky for\Nputtin' all this together.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.07,0:03:16.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your friends should be waiting\Nfor you at Grove 42.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:16.44,0:03:20.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm so eager to see them again,\Nmy heart is beating out of my chest.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.08,0:03:23.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kidding. Obviously,\Nmy chest is an empty void!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:23.41,0:03:26.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROOK laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.62,0:03:30.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[FRANKY]\NSo, here's the skinny, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.43,0:03:34.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Luffy's on the island, somewhere,\Nbut the Navy's about to close in,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.63,0:03:37.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and the rest of the crew\Nis headed to Grove 42.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.28,0:03:38.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Meet us there.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.12,0:03:39.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roger that, Franky.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:39.22,0:03:39.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TRANSPONDER SNAIL A]\NCu-lick.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:39.99,0:03:40.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.89,0:03:42.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Great. You mean you weren't listening?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.62,0:03:44.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, let's see.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.66,0:03:50.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Navy, come here.\NUs pirates, ship. Run away.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:50.99,0:03:52.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that clear enough?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:52.19,0:03:53.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are you talking like that?!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:53.52,0:03:55.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you hit your head or somethin'?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:55.46,0:03:56.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI sighs]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:56.69,0:03:59.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry. I just thought I'd\Nspeak on your level for once.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.49,0:04:00.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NHuh?!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:00.96,0:04:05.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right then. After this,\Nstupid cook die.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:05.26,0:04:06.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Real funny.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.66,0:04:08.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, you know what all the\Nracket over there's about?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:08.90,0:04:09.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:10.02,0:04:11.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES yelling]
Dialogue: 50,0:04:12.17,0:04:14.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NYou, right. Noisy, there.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:23.35,0:04:25.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE LUFFY]\NAll right, that's\Nenough yakking! Listen!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:27.41,0:04:31.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Turns out Sanji and Zoro found\None of the guys who insulted me.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.65,0:04:33.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In fact, he's here with us right now!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:35.06,0:04:37.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look at this little punk!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:37.09,0:04:40.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna beat a lesson into\Nhim with my own two hands!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.23,0:04:44.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Cause when you piss me off,\Nthen things get ugly!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.49,0:04:47.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And let this be a lesson\Nto all of you, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.39,0:04:50.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you ever cross me,\Nif you ever disrespect me,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:50.72,0:04:52.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you're gonna end up\Njust like this chump!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:52.99,0:04:55.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't forget who's\Nthe boss of this crew!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:55.23,0:04:56.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that perfectly clear?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:56.89,0:04:58.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES yelling]
Dialogue: 50,0:04:58.50,0:05:02.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He earned that bounty somehow,\Nand it wasn't by playing nicey-nice.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.29,0:05:03.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's with this guy?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.92,0:05:07.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro, Sanji, he a friend\Nof yours or somethin'?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.23,0:05:09.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Cause I don't think he likes me.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:09.79,0:05:12.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've got you surrounded!\NNobody move an inch!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.90,0:05:16.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy, you and the rest\Nof your crew are under arrest!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:16.17,0:05:17.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Surrender immediately!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.85,0:05:19.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Navy?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:19.12,0:05:20.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And don't bother running away.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:20.69,0:05:22.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've blocked off\Nevery exit in Grove 46.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.99,0:05:23.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys leave with us,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.86,0:05:25.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,or you're gonna leave in a body bag!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.24,0:05:26.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But my disguise is perfect.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:26.81,0:05:29.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How did the Navy know I was here?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:29.61,0:05:30.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? Why would you think\Nthis was about you?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:30.95,0:05:33.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain, please tell me\Nwe're not all dead.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:33.55,0:05:35.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop flippin' out. We'll be just fine!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:35.72,0:05:37.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why do you think we\Nrecruited all these guys?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.96,0:05:40.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've got pirates with\N100 million bounties here!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:40.12,0:05:41.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But this is scary.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:41.49,0:05:42.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then sit back and watch!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:43.14,0:05:44.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heh.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:44.44,0:05:45.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Caribou, you're up!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:45.94,0:05:49.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Use that Marine as a shield and\Nmake us a path outta this dump!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.28,0:05:50.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, what Marine?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:50.62,0:05:54.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We sent a scout here earlier,\Nand it looks like he was taken captive.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:54.25,0:05:55.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit, that's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.69,0:05:57.52,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE LUFFY]\NWhat the hell are you doin', Caribou?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.52,0:06:00.16,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,We need him to escape!\NDid you even hear me?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.90,0:06:00.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[CARIBOU laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:00.47,0:06:02.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Although that would be\Nterribly convenient,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:03.76,0:06:05.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it simply won't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.80,0:06:06.87,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE LUFFY]\NWhy not?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.62,0:06:13.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because he told me he hadn't\Ncalled the Navy yet,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.12,0:06:09.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and that makes him\Na filthy little liar.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:13.85,0:06:14.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINES gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.86,0:06:15.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Caribou, no!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:17.11,0:06:18.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.52,0:06:19.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gunshot]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:23.17,0:06:24.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINES gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.87,0:06:26.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE LUFFY]\NThat crazy bastard!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:26.74,0:06:29.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who's the captain here, damn it?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.33,0:06:32.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, well. So much for that plan.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:32.24,0:06:34.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You high and mighty types\Nseem to think it's all right
Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.70,0:06:37.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to lie to someone if they're\Na so-called "bad guy."
Dialogue: 50,0:06:37.57,0:06:39.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, I object to that.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.44,0:06:41.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.28,0:06:42.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I guess they're not surrendering, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:42.84,0:06:44.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Should've figured as much.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:44.84,0:06:47.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Charge! Show the pirates no mercy!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:47.15,0:06:48.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINES yelling]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:48.85,0:06:51.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good luck! Our boss is Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:51.22,0:06:54.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's not gonna lose to a buncha\Nchumps like you! Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:54.39,0:06:55.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES yelling]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.25,0:06:58.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ALL yelling]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:58.90,0:07:00.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you've got a plan, I'd hurry!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:00.77,0:07:03.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen to your captain!\NYou guys're pissing me off!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.01,0:07:06.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That guy just said that I was his boss,\Nbut I've never even seen him before.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:06.84,0:07:09.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I do not have time to deal\Nwith your nonsense right now.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:21.17,0:07:23.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aim for their captain and charge!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.96,0:07:26.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know you.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:26.76,0:07:30.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're "Lip-Service" Doughty.\NYour bounty's 88 million!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:31.04,0:07:32.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.30,0:07:34.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You may be idiots, but at\Nleast you're not cowards.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:34.74,0:07:36.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let him intimidate you! Uh!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:37.01,0:07:38.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ALBION yelling]
Dialogue: 50,0:07:38.38,0:07:40.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ALL scream]
Dialogue: 50,0:07:40.28,0:07:41.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ALBION chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:07:41.29,0:07:42.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Holy crap.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.28,0:07:46.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's got a bounty of 92 million.\NThat's "Gashed" Albion!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.20,0:07:52.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE S]\NWe'll take them down!\NJustice is on our side!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:52.34,0:07:53.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[MARINES]\N– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:53.62,0:07:54.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:07:53.62,0:07:55.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The ground is soaked with\Nthe blood of hypocrites.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:57.01,0:07:59.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Its overwhelming stench\Nmakes me so sick.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:59.71,0:08:02.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE K]\NA 210 million bounty,\N"Wet-Haired" Caribou!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:02.64,0:08:03.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CARIBOU]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.87,0:08:05.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Too late to surrender now!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:06.28,0:08:07.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:07.28,0:08:09.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it, no one said he\Nhad a Devil Fruit power!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:08.31,0:08:09.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:09.84,0:08:12.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why don't we all slow down a bit?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.12,0:08:16.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haven't you heard that stress\Ncan lead to an early grave?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.72,0:08:17.59,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE K]\NMy sword!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.59,0:08:18.82,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.73,0:08:38.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nobody told me they were gonna be here.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:38.03,0:08:38.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES scream]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:38.96,0:08:40.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I kinda wanna beat up those robot guys,
Dialogue: 50,0:08:41.14,0:08:43.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but Hancock said to stay outta\Ntrouble, so I guess I won't.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.61,0:08:47.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those things'd vaporize the mustache\Noff your stupid face, you nutbag!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:53.44,0:08:56.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Monkey D. Luffy has been\Nidentified. Commence attack.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:56.80,0:08:59.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those things are aiming straight at me!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:59.07,0:09:02.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can I even run or am I just dead?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.18,0:09:04.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was hopin' I'd get to\Nrumble with them someday!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:10.47,0:09:13.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Lip-Service" Doughty\Nidentified and subdued.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:13.51,0:09:16.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sustained no damage.\NSearching for next target.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.34,0:09:18.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES]\NCaptain Doughty!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.94,0:09:20.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES scream]
Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.85,0:09:24.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Follow the Pacifistas! Capture\Nevery pirate in your path!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:24.24,0:09:25.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[MARINES]\N– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.47,0:09:26.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doughty's out cold!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:26.74,0:09:29.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A bounty like that and these guys\Ntook him down in only one shot?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.91,0:09:31.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're screwed.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:31.08,0:09:34.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Captain, wait for us! Dang it!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:34.53,0:09:36.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I ain't waiting for nobody!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.13,0:09:39.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That thing took out Doughty!\NI don't stand a chance!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:44.04,0:09:45.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE H]\NStraw Hat, do something!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:45.28,0:09:47.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the only one\Nwho can stop them now!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:47.11,0:09:48.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES scream]
Dialogue: 50,0:09:48.25,0:09:52.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hate to beg, Captain, but your whole\Ncrew is about to get blown up over here!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.15,0:09:54.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere left to run!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.35,0:09:57.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Aw, crap, he's gone!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:57.45,0:09:59.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where is Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.08,0:10:01.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They keep calling for\Ntheir captain, but...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:02.45,0:10:04.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Slow down, you guys.\NMy side is killing me!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:05.00,0:10:07.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Screw your side! The lasers\Nare gonna kill you!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:08.83,0:10:10.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get your fat ass out of my way!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:10.96,0:10:13.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Who is this idiot?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:12.55,0:10:14.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[FAKE LUFFY yelping]
Dialogue: 50,0:10:14.82,0:10:16.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's here!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.00,0:10:19.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:19.26,0:10:22.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES cheering]
Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.64,0:10:27.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Am I mistaken, or did they\Ncall you "Captain Luffy"?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.70,0:10:28.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why wouldn't they call me that?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:28.97,0:10:31.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I mean, you realize who you're\Ntalking to right now, don't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:31.87,0:10:36.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go! Get outta my way before I grab your\Nintestines and pull them out your ear!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:36.01,0:10:37.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd run if I were you!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:37.64,0:10:41.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're face-to-face with the son\Nof Dragon the Revolutionary!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:41.15,0:10:44.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That means I'm the grandson\Nof the hero Garp!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:44.09,0:10:46.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, and my bounty?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.16,0:10:49.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It clocks in at 400\Nmillion berries! I'm...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.90,0:10:54.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're not Straw Hat,\Nyou human pile of garbage.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.37,0:10:56.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not even close!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:58.40,0:10:59.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE N]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.17,0:11:00.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ALBION]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.11,0:11:01.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE O]\NUh?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.51,0:11:04.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[MARINES, PIRATES]\N– What?!\N– What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.11,0:11:07.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE X]\NThat guy just took out Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.08,0:11:09.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So that's it. Fools.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.35,0:11:14.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They thought that they could join\Nthe Straw Hats and enter the New World.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.29,0:11:17.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,PX-5, who is this imposter?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:20.40,0:11:23.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PX-5]\NConfirmed. He is\N"Triple-Tongued" Demaro Black.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:23.63,0:11:26.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A pirate with a 26\Nmillion berry bounty.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:27.00,0:11:29.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, if he's only worth\N26 million, that means...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:30.57,0:11:32.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[PIRATES]\N– He's a fake?!\N– He's a fake?!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:32.70,0:11:34.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[groans]
Dialogue: 50,0:11:34.87,0:11:36.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Book it, guys! The jig is up!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:36.83,0:11:38.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell are we\Nsupposed to do now?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.34,0:11:41.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's bad enough that\Nthis guy tricked us,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.01,0:11:43.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but now he got the\NNavy called on us, too?!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:43.61,0:11:45.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guess the real Straw\NHat is dead after all.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.98,0:11:49.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell?! You mean Straw\NHat didn't get fat and gross?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:49.32,0:11:51.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This guy was just fat\Nand gross to begin with?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:51.65,0:11:53.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWait, what?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.36,0:11:56.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That fat gross guy was\Npretending to be me?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:56.00,0:12:01.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That Sanji and Zoro... they looked real,\Nbut I guess they were fakes, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.03,0:12:04.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow, this is blowin' my mind.\NI gotta get out of here.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:04.48,0:12:07.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SENTOMARU]\NI know you aren't real Straw Hats\Nand you're just victims of this fool,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:07.85,0:12:09.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but you're still pirates.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:09.31,0:12:12.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That means the lot of you\Nare coming with us!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:13.95,0:12:18.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And although I cannot imagine why,\Nthe real Straw Hat is here somewhere, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:19.52,0:12:23.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When we entered the area, PX-5 detected\Nhim on the stage with the imposters.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:23.96,0:12:26.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fire on Straw Hat, PX-5!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:34.97,0:12:37.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES screaming]
Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.81,0:12:39.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NThat was close!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.58,0:12:43.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYou almost blew up my all my lunches!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.65,0:12:45.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What did food ever do to you?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.85,0:12:50.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's... It's really him, isn't it?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.31,0:12:58.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[PIRATES]\N– That's Straw Hat Luffy!\N– That's Straw Hat Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:59.94,0:13:01.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ALL yell]
Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.08,0:13:04.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The real Straw Hat was here\Nand we didn't even know?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:04.31,0:13:05.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nothing has changed, men!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:05.48,0:13:08.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We came here to capture Straw\NHat and that's what we're doing!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.31,0:13:09.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[MARINES]\N– Sir!\N– Sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.01,0:13:10.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So there you are!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.68,0:13:14.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Agh! I had enough of you\Nthe last time we fought!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.27,0:13:15.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm just tryin' to set sail!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:15.84,0:13:17.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not supposed to start any trouble!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.90,0:13:21.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SENTOMARU]\NOh, it's no trouble,\Nbut you won't be setting sail.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.44,0:13:25.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unlike two years ago, I'm an\Nofficial Navy officer now.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:25.82,0:13:28.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That means I'm taking you in\Nif it's the last thing I do!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.49,0:13:29.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,PX-5, fire!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:37.73,0:13:39.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that all?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.87,0:13:43.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:49.34,0:13:51.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[LUFFY]\NSecond Gear.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.13,0:13:59.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}You're way too slow.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:07.60,0:14:10.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[LUFFY]\NGum-Gum... Jet Pistol!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:20.04,0:14:22.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is worse than I thought.\NHe can use Haki now.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:24.95,0:14:28.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[PIRATES]\N– He beat a Pacifista! And all it took was one punch!\N– He beat a Pacifista! And all it took was one punch!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.78,0:14:36.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.83,0:14:40.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Though I have a feeling I'm\Ngonna see you again somewhere!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.70,0:14:42.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SENTOMARU]\NGet back here and fight me!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:42.10,0:14:44.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let him go, men! Hurry!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:44.30,0:14:45.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[MARINES]\N– Yes, sir!\N– Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:45.99,0:14:48.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckling]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.08,0:14:50.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NHey! Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.15,0:14:50.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.88,0:14:52.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Shoulda known!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.66,0:14:54.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All I had to do was\Nfollow the explosions
Dialogue: 50,0:14:56.43,0:14:58.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:58.40,0:15:00.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, it's you for real this time!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:00.60,0:15:03.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This Zoro's not even fat! Way to go!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.48,0:15:05.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roronoa and Black Foot.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:05.35,0:15:07.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I should've known\Nthey were still alive.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:07.08,0:15:09.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right, PX-7, attack!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.35,0:15:10.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[BOTH]\N– Huh?\N– Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:16.93,0:15:18.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[SANJI, ZORO]\N– Get lost!\N– Get lost!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:24.34,0:15:25.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NI'm the one who got him.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:25.64,0:15:28.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep dreaming! My kick broke his neck!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.42,0:15:30.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES scream]
Dialogue: 50,0:15:30.36,0:15:33.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the real Straw Hats!\NThey're monsters!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.29,0:15:36.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The fake ones were nothing\Nlike this at all!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.56,0:15:43.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By the way, Luffy, you're number nine.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:43.73,0:15:45.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nobody cares! Would\Nyou give up on that?!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:45.90,0:15:48.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone's waiting at the\NSunny. Let's get moving.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:48.33,0:15:49.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NGot it!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:50.90,0:15:54.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're not missing this chance!\NEvery last Marine, after them!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:54.44,0:15:55.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[MARINES]\N– Yes, sir!\N– Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:55.82,0:16:00.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Man, it's been forever, huh?\NI bet everyone's so cool now!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:00.22,0:16:01.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:01.86,0:16:03.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha! Uh.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:09.39,0:16:10.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened? Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:12.50,0:16:14.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:16:14.08,0:16:16.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.35,0:16:20.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NRayleigh!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.86,0:16:23.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:21.73,0:16:24.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:16:24.07,0:16:25.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[RAYLEIGH]\NI came to check on you,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:30.29,0:16:33.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but it seems you have\Nthis under control.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:33.42,0:16:36.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In fact, you're even stronger\Nthan when I left you.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:36.36,0:16:37.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:37.63,0:16:39.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Finally time to see your friends.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:39.73,0:16:42.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've been waiting for long enough.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:42.53,0:16:44.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Rayleigh. For real.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:44.70,0:16:47.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You did so much for me\Nthese past two years!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:48.06,0:16:51.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[RAYLEIGH]\NHa-ha. No need\Nto get sappy on me. Just go.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:57.31,0:16:58.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[RAYLEIGH]\NHm?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:00.70,0:17:01.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NOne last thing.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:04.17,0:17:05.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NI'm gonna do it.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:09.99,0:17:13.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be the King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:13.86,0:17:15.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You hear me?!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:28.36,0:17:29.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:29.73,0:17:31.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and capture them already!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:31.68,0:17:33.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINES yelling]
Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.65,0:17:35.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NGotta move, Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:35.45,0:17:37.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NWe appreciate the help, Rayleigh!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:37.35,0:17:40.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, we're off!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.02,0:17:42.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks again for everything.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:42.56,0:17:45.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See ya! I'm outta here!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.96,0:17:51.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[RAYLEIGH]\NGood luck.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:14.51,0:18:16.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let nothing stop you\Nfrom reaching the top!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:19.65,0:18:23.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE CC]\NThe Straw Hats are making\Na beeline for Grove 42!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:23.79,0:18:25.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Catch them at any cost!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.33,0:18:31.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE B]\NThe hell?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:32.49,0:18:33.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINES gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:18:33.83,0:18:36.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE B]\NDark King Rayleigh.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.10,0:18:38.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just let the boy sail?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:38.20,0:18:40.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's been out of the game,\Nso take it easy.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:43.24,0:18:45.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh. That's an intense line.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:46.38,0:18:49.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you think that's intense,\Nthen why don't you try crossing it?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:54.89,0:18:57.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWhoa! That's a lot!\NYou really went all out!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:58.12,0:18:59.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's inside?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:59.89,0:19:01.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NIt's our food stock.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:01.31,0:19:03.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I bought in bulk 'cause I'm\Nsure everyone's stomachs
Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.45,0:19:05.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,have gotten bigger\Nover these two years.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:05.92,0:19:07.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This should keep us\Nall happy for a while.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:07.74,0:19:11.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good thinking! I haven't had\Nyour cooking in way too long!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:11.27,0:19:13.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Over here! We found them!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:13.66,0:19:15.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINES yelling]
Dialogue: 50,0:19:15.10,0:19:17.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NCrap! They got ahead of us somehow!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:17.80,0:19:19.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like we're gonna have\Nto fight our way through!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:19.80,0:19:21.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Charge in! We've got this!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:21.70,0:19:22.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINES yell]
Dialogue: 50,0:19:22.77,0:19:24.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NEGATIVE GHOST laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:19:24.14,0:19:25.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE D]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:27.15,0:19:29.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE G]\NI'm as worthless as a flea.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:29.69,0:19:31.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Get up before...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:33.21,0:19:36.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! What happened to their morale?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.15,0:19:40.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NEGATIVE GHOST laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:19:43.23,0:19:45.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE D]\NI... I am nothing but a louse.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:47.04,0:19:48.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This sure looks familiar.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:48.37,0:19:50.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NEGATIVE GHOST laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.58,0:19:55.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PERONA]\NHow did I know it was\Nyou guys causing that ruckus?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:57.25,0:19:58.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So typical.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:00.15,0:20:03.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're fooling around with the Navy\Nwhen you should've been gone long ago!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:03.52,0:20:06.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Well, aren't you\Na sight for sore eyes?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:07.57,0:20:08.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWe know her?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:08.47,0:20:09.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NSpeak for yourself!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:09.78,0:20:12.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you were smart,\Nyou would've bailed by now!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:12.04,0:20:15.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't even be here if it\Nweren't for me, so don't start, mister!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:15.88,0:20:18.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who knows where you would've\Nwound up on your own?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:19.90,0:20:22.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The least you could do is be gracious!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:22.96,0:20:24.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PERONA yelps]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:24.03,0:20:26.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's an actual woman.\NWith real life girly parts!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:26.60,0:20:29.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course I am! What the hell\Nis your damage, you freak?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:29.30,0:20:31.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right, enough of this.\NYou guys need to get moving.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:31.60,0:20:34.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's Navy ships nearby,\Nso you're running out of time!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:35.18,0:20:37.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you don't get out of here\Nsoon, you'll never escape.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:56.23,0:20:57.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right! You're here!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:57.80,0:20:58.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a surprise!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:00.91,0:21:01.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I didn't think you'd\Nabandon stardom! Attaboy!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:02.13,0:21:03.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:21:03.87,0:21:05.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nothing could keep me from coming back.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:05.54,0:21:07.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've missed you all so.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:07.37,0:21:10.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see that you two have only\Ngrown lovelier in our time apart.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:13.52,0:21:17.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROOK]\NWith all that in mind,\Nthere's something I need to know.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:18.83,0:21:21.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ooh. It's already song time, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:25.54,0:21:28.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please, Nami.\NMay I look at your panties?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:28.26,0:21:29.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NNo way in hell!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.83,0:21:33.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I never let you look at them two years\Nago, why would I let you see them now?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:33.00,0:21:35.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right. I was just excited to see you.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:35.57,0:21:37.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It made my soul shake.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:37.23,0:21:38.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And it's still shaking right now.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:38.77,0:21:40.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In fact, it's about to leak\Nout of my ear, I think...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:40.72,0:21:44.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[USOPP]\NI didn't think you could have\Na muscle spasm without any muscles.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:44.17,0:21:45.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:45.58,0:21:49.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How is it none of you have grown\Nup after all of this time?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:51.43,0:21:54.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROOK]\NRejection aside, I was actually\Nexpecting to be the last one here.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:54.70,0:21:58.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Chopper is off\Nlooking for our missing companions.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.87,0:21:58.63,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[LUFFY]\NHey!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:05.79,0:22:07.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Talk about perfect timing!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:07.66,0:22:10.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NGuys!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:11.93,0:22:14.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:18.76,0:22:20.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP, BROOK, NAMI laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:22:20.42,0:22:23.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NLuffy! Zoro! Sanji!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:23.43,0:22:25.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:26.03,0:22:27.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:22:27.70,0:22:31.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Together again! I've been\Nwaiting for this day!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:31.59,0:22:34.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And everyone looks stronger! I like it!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:34.50,0:22:36.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:22:36.74,0:22:38.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It feels like it's been forever!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:39.13,0:22:42.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:22:42.24,0:22:46.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like we're the last... Hi, guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:52.91,0:22:54.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(627.5,1053)}– [sputtering]\N– [CHOPPER gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:22:54.65,0:22:55.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:55.68,0:22:57.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:22:58.06,0:23:00.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NHe's hemorrhaging!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:06.59,0:23:08.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NThanks a lot for the ride!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:08.19,0:23:10.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell everyone back in the\NBirdie Kingdom I say "hi."
Dialogue: 50,0:23:10.76,0:23:12.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BIRDIE A caws]
Dialogue: 50,0:23:12.61,0:23:14.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How is he? Has the\Nbleeding stopped yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.81,0:23:18.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not one... but two beautiful\Nwomen in front of me...
Dialogue: 50,0:23:18.26,0:23:20.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay with me, man. Don't give up yet!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:20.57,0:23:23.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's no good, Chopper! He's\Ngetting paler by the second!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:23.37,0:23:28.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah! You... look... so cool, Franky!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:28.08,0:23:30.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you think so? Good!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:30.51,0:23:34.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But even if you didn't, I could\Nchange my style at will. Mecha!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:34.34,0:23:36.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Mecha"? Let me try!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.14,0:23:37.47,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NOkay, focus!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:37.47,0:23:39.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is no time to be fooling around!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:39.84,0:23:43.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We need to get outta here while we\Ncan before the Navy's on top of us!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:43.58,0:23:44.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:23:44.82,0:23:46.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[STRAW HATS yelp]
Dialogue: 50,0:23:46.16,0:23:50.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, it looks like we're too late!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:50.16,0:23:52.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see three Navy ships.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:55.97,0:23:58.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we don't do something fast,\Nwe're gonna be dead in the water!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:58.47,0:24:01.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE H]\NFire! Sink that ship at all costs!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:13.50,0:24:15.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? They stopped in midair.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:15.93,0:24:18.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait. Captain.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:20.54,0:24:22.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE I]\NIt's the Kuja Pirates!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:24.94,0:24:28.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HANCOCK]\NAnswer me this, knaves.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:28.01,0:24:34.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Which one of you had the audacity\Nto place your disgusting ship in my path?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:42.12,0:24:44.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That flag... It can't be.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:44.59,0:24:45.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know it?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:45.86,0:24:47.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NThat's the Kuja symbol.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:47.26,0:24:50.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're a strong crew of Amazonians\Nlead by one of the Seven Warlords.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:50.76,0:24:51.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're joking, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:51.76,0:24:54.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not at all. Her name is Boa Hancock.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:54.03,0:24:55.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They say anyone who lays eyes on her
Dialogue: 50,0:24:55.93,0:24:59.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,will be enamored by her beauty and turned\Nto stone, unless she grants you mercy.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:59.54,0:25:02.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROOK]\NWhoa! Oh, I can see why!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:02.07,0:25:03.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beauty starts and ends with her!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:03.90,0:25:05.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I had eyes, they'd be sparkling!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:05.63,0:25:08.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow! She's like\Na real-life goddess!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:07.61,0:25:08.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:25:10.86,0:25:11.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is she really that fine? Lemme see!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:12.23,0:25:14.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My goddess. Where? Gotta find her.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:14.96,0:25:17.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanna see. I wanna. I wanna.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:18.77,0:25:20.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's as hard as a rock!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:21.07,0:25:22.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHancock said she wasn't comin' here.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:22.93,0:25:24.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[USOPP, SANJI, BROOK]\N– Huh?\N– Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:24.47,0:25:26.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE H]\NWe order you to move\Nyour ship outta the way!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:26.98,0:25:29.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're interfering with\Nofficial Navy business!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:29.69,0:25:31.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's your ship that's in my way.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:31.79,0:25:35.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So I suppose it's you that's "interfering\Nwith official Navy business."
Dialogue: 50,0:25:35.02,0:25:37.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh. That's really an immature argument.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:37.59,0:25:38.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I get what I want.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:38.83,0:25:40.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINES gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:25:40.89,0:25:44.06,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[HANCOCK]\NGo, Luffy. I've bought you some time.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:44.14,0:25:45.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:45.13,0:25:48.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She winked at us!\NI could die of ecstasy!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:48.80,0:25:49.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NLooks like we have an opening.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:49.97,0:25:51.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's set sail!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:51.04,0:25:53.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you know that Warlord or something?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:53.19,0:25:57.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYeah, I made friends with her when\Nthat bear guy sent me to Amazon Lily.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:57.64,0:26:00.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You mean the legendary island\Nwhere only women live?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:00.81,0:26:02.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I never believed it was a real place.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:02.50,0:26:05.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've been pallin' around\Nwith the Pirate Empress?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:05.63,0:26:06.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come clean, now!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:06.87,0:26:09.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You weren't really training at all\Nthese past two years, were you?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:09.78,0:26:11.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What else would I have been doin'?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:11.09,0:26:13.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NDamn! It's not fair!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:13.26,0:26:14.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That would've been a\Ndream come true for me!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:14.82,0:26:16.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWhat's his problem?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:17.61,0:26:20.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARGARET]\NWow! So those are Luffy's friends!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:20.52,0:26:23.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've never seen so many strange\Ncreatures together before.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:23.69,0:26:24.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's one...
Dialogue: 50,0:26:24.39,0:26:27.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They look like such a fun crew!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:27.16,0:26:30.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NOkay! Everyone in position to set sail!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:30.13,0:26:31.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(526,1053)}– Aye, aye!\N[SANJI]\N– Yes, Nami-swan!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:31.93,0:26:33.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NWhat's the matter, Usopp?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:34.88,0:26:36.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Something just occurred to me.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:36.65,0:26:39.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You never said you beat\Nthe Navy soldiers inland.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:39.01,0:26:40.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We didn't.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:40.09,0:26:41.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We just flew past them,\Nbut we could hear them shouting
Dialogue: 50,0:26:41.99,0:26:44.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,from behind us in the distance.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:44.62,0:26:47.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NThen what could be stopping\Nthem from coming after us?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:53.88,0:26:55.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINES yelling]
Dialogue: 50,0:26:55.48,0:26:58.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is backup unit Platoon\NThree! Do you copy?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:58.92,0:27:00.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINES scream]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.22,0:27:02.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[MARINE L]\NWe read you. What's happening?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:02.03,0:27:04.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE K]\NWe are unable to reach Grove 42!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.83,0:27:05.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[MARINE L]\NWhat? Why?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:05.83,0:27:07.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE K]\NWell, because...
Dialogue: 50,0:27:07.93,0:27:10.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There are giant bugs currently\Nhalting our advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.36,0:27:11.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[MARINE L]\NWait, giant what?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:11.67,0:27:15.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE K screaming]
Dialogue: 50,0:27:15.00,0:27:17.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These things are monsters!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:20.42,0:27:21.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE DD]\NShoot it!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:23.95,0:27:26.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:27:29.20,0:27:33.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HERACLES]\NI won't let anyone get in the way\Nof Usopp'n goin' adventurin'.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:33.40,0:27:34.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HERACLES sniffs]
Dialogue: 50,0:27:36.67,0:27:39.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HERACLES]\NMen don't shed\Ntears when they part ways!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:40.54,0:27:43.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good Luck, Usopp'n.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:45.04,0:27:47.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NWho cares why they\Naren't comin' after us?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:47.55,0:27:50.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The worse their lives are,\Nthe better ours'll be.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:50.05,0:27:52.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heh. It's time to get outta here.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:52.35,0:27:54.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami, lead the way.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:54.72,0:27:55.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NYou got it.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:57.56,0:27:58.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:00.85,0:28:02.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE M]\NThis is Platoon Four.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:02.25,0:28:03.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Afraid I have bad news.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:03.86,0:28:07.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All our gunpowder has been\Nruined by a sudden rain shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.26,0:28:09.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[MARINE EE]\NWhat?! That isn't possible.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:09.86,0:28:14.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The forecast for Sabaody Archipelago\Ntoday is clear and sunny!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:17.81,0:28:19.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HAREDAS]\NThunder would be excessive.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:19.94,0:28:22.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After all, we don't wanna\Nscare the civilians, now.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:22.81,0:28:26.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wasn't expecting those bubbles\Nto give us so much grief.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:26.15,0:28:28.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bubbles or not, you can't\Ncomplain about the wind.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:28.75,0:28:32.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, sir, that breeze got us where\Nwe wanted to be right on schedule.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:32.56,0:28:33.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, of course it did!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:33.83,0:28:36.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When it's something for Nami,\Nshe gets nothing but the best.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:36.63,0:28:38.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:28:38.23,0:28:40.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ALL laugh]
Dialogue: 50,0:28:40.30,0:28:42.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HAREDAS]\NWe'll miss you on\NWeatheria, young lady.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:42.89,0:28:46.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But get out there and give it your all!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:02.42,0:29:03.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! What's it doin'?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:05.66,0:29:08.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are we sure this is\Nsupposed to inflate?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:12.07,0:29:15.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NWhoa! Now our boat's got a bubble roof!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:15.74,0:29:16.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is how it works.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:17.22,0:29:19.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A ship that is properly coated\Nhas the ability to withstand
Dialogue: 50,0:29:19.96,0:29:23.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,almost any sort of pressure,\Nbut it also has very little buoyancy.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:23.53,0:29:27.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The floating bag beneath the ship\Nis the only thing keeping us afloat.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:27.03,0:29:30.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By deflating it, the Sunny will\Nbecome less buoyant and begin to sink.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:30.99,0:29:32.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's pretty simple, really.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:32.72,0:29:34.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[BOTH]\N– Huh. Interesting.\N– Huh. Interesting.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:34.28,0:29:35.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NMaybe not simple enough.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:35.62,0:29:37.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Forget about it for now,\Nlet's spread the sail!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:37.72,0:29:38.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[BROOK, CHOPPER]\N– Why?\N– Why?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:38.69,0:29:40.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We use it to catch the water current,
Dialogue: 50,0:29:40.35,0:29:42.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,similar to how we would use\Nthe wind above sea level.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:42.93,0:29:46.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was hopin' we'd just sink\Ndown to Fishman Island. Darn.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:46.37,0:29:47.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NAll right!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:47.57,0:29:50.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'd better hurry unless we\Nwanna get in another fight!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:50.61,0:29:54.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE N]\NThis is Central Unit\NPlatoon Five at Grove 42!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:54.11,0:29:55.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have an emergency!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:55.61,0:29:57.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The troops from Platoon\NTwo have been found,
Dialogue: 50,0:29:57.45,0:29:59.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but they've all succumbed\Nto a severe depression!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.83,0:30:02.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[MARINE O]\NTell 'em to suck it\Nup and get back in the fight!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:02.97,0:30:05.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE GG]\NI suck. I should've\Nbeen born a water flea.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:05.80,0:30:10.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE N]\NWhat we've been able to gather is that\NStraw Hat Luffy flew off on a giant bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.14,0:30:11.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[MARINE O]\NSo he's not even there?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:11.58,0:30:13.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then what are you guys shooting at?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:13.58,0:30:16.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE N]\NWe are currently under\Nattack by unknown enemies!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:17.26,0:30:19.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NReinforcements got here quick.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:19.13,0:30:21.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We were just about to leave.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:21.13,0:30:22.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heads up!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:24.83,0:30:27.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE P]\NThe Straw Hat ship is now within range!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:27.57,0:30:29.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh. But we may have a problem!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:29.47,0:30:32.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A large bird is heading\Nstraight for us!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:41.49,0:30:42.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:43.32,0:30:44.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:30:44.53,0:30:45.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,From behind, too?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:45.86,0:30:47.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NI got it!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:49.77,0:30:51.10,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NLike what ya see, Nami?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:51.49,0:30:56.01,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I've gotten a lot stronger.\NGo ahead and take it in.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:56.01,0:30:58.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(710,1053)}– [sputtering]\N– No, not again!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:00.89,0:31:03.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE Q]\NPlatoon Five, come in! What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.66,0:31:05.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[MARINE R]\NWell, it isn't good.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:05.77,0:31:07.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've hit interference.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:07.17,0:31:09.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We couldn't possibly\Nhave anticipated this.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:10.25,0:31:11.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE HH]\NAh! Have mercy!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:13.36,0:31:14.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BOTH gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:31:14.59,0:31:17.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How could you ever think of\Nturning beauties like us away?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:17.46,0:31:18.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As if!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:18.63,0:31:20.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GREEN HAIR QUEEN]\NMaybe they're all shy.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:20.70,0:31:23.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PINK HAIR QUEEN]\NThere's nothing to be ashamed of, boys!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:24.20,0:31:27.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's have a cup of tea!\NAnd cookies, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:27.90,0:31:31.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How awful! Truly, this\Nis worse than death!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:34.44,0:31:38.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hi, there! You've got\Nsuch an adorable face!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:38.21,0:31:39.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE R]\NAh! No! Let me go!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:39.61,0:31:42.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINES yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.07,0:31:43.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[MARINE Q]\NWhat's wrong now?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.14,0:31:46.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Platoon Five, finish your report!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:46.76,0:31:49.02,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[ELIZABETH]\NThis is for you, Sanji. Make it count!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:50.81,0:31:51.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[chokes]
Dialogue: 50,0:31:51.78,0:31:54.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa! Take it\Neasy, Sanji! Breathe!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:54.38,0:31:56.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh. Usopp. It's you.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:56.91,0:32:00.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry, it felt like someone had\Ngotten a death grip on my heart.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:00.92,0:32:01.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bag's deflated!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:01.92,0:32:04.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Awesome! You guys ready?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:04.36,0:32:06.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NYeah, we're all set!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:06.99,0:32:08.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NThat it, Nami?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:08.33,0:32:11.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Just say the word, Captain.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:13.93,0:32:15.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:32:17.75,0:32:18.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NAll right.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:23.63,0:32:25.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen up, guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:25.15,0:32:27.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's a lot I wanna say,\Nbut we don't have much time.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:28.97,0:32:30.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One thing can't wait, though.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:30.67,0:32:33.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What you went through these past\Ntwo years was selfish of me,
Dialogue: 50,0:32:33.67,0:32:35.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so thanks for puttin' up with it.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:35.48,0:32:38.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You make it sound like this\Nhas never happened before.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:38.02,0:32:39.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's no joke!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:39.17,0:32:41.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've always been a\Nselfish piece of work.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:41.70,0:32:44.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:32:45.94,0:32:49.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE T]\NRear Admiral!\NThe pirate ship is submerging!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:49.55,0:32:50.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:50.88,0:32:54.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen, you have no idea how\Ndangerous those pirates are!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:54.72,0:32:57.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Move your ship! Now. Pretty please?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:57.15,0:32:59.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[MARINES]\N– Yes, please?\N– Yes, please?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:59.96,0:33:02.53,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[HANCOCK]\NTake care of yourself, Luffy.
